# Rename this file to `CNAME` (inside `landing/CNAME`) or set your custom
# subdomain in GitHub Repository -> Settings -> Pages -> Custom domain:
#
#   tchiko.yourdomain.com
#
# Then add a DNS CNAME record at your domain registrar:
#   Host/Name: tchiko
#   Target:    <your-github-org-or-username>.github.io
